  "id": "linkam_thms600",
  "manufacturer": "Linkam Scientific Instruments",
  "model": "THMS600",
  "family": "temperature-controlled microscope heating/freezing stage (liquid-nitrogen cooled)",
  "description": "Heating and freezing stage for upright optical microscopes and Raman/confocal/X-ray setups. Silver heating block with Pt100 sensor, 22 mm diameter sample area, 2.0 mm light aperture, single thin lid window; < -195 °C to 600 °C when the optional LNP96-S liquid nitrogen pump is fitted. Controlled by a T96-S controller. Electrical variant THMSEL600; separate vacuum (THMS350V), pressure (THMS600-PS) and FTIR (FTIR600) variants exist.",
